WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:04.880
Hi, Mystery Recapped here. Today, I’m&nbsp;
going to explain an Australian science&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:04.880 --> 00:00:09.760
fiction film called “2067.” Spoilers&nbsp;
ahead! Watch out and take care!
&nbsp;

00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:19.120
The premise of the movie is set in 2067, when the&nbsp;
world has been destroyed beyond rehabilitation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:19.120 --> 00:00:24.720
because of climate change. All plant life has been&nbsp;
extinct. With the lack of plant life, the amount&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:29.840
of oxygen in the air has decreased exponentially.&nbsp;
People have to buy artificial oxygen to survive.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.720 --> 00:00:36.320
Ninety-nine percent of the world has gone dark.&nbsp;
People suffocate to death. In such conditions,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.320 --> 00:00:41.120
only one city in Australia has survived, and it&nbsp;
is all thanks to a company called the Chronicorp&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:41.120 --> 00:00:46.960
corporation that manufactures synthetic oxygen.&nbsp;
However, artificial oxygen causes a fatal disease&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:51.520
called ‘the sickness’ over time. Humankind has&nbsp;
mere years before it goes fully extinct.
&nbsp;

00:00:52.320 --> 00:00:56.240
Ethan Whyte is a resident of the&nbsp;
Australian city. He and his friend,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:56.240 --> 00:01:01.200
Jude, work as mechanics in the Chronicorp&nbsp;
corporation. The corporation is also working&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:01.200 --> 00:01:06.560
day and night to find a cure for ‘the sickness’&nbsp;
and a way to save the world. Ethan’s wife, Xanthe,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:06.560 --> 00:01:12.000
also has the sickness. Ethan works hard day&nbsp;
and night to earn, and buy her better oxygen.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:17.280
One day, as Ethan and Jude work in the tunnel,&nbsp;
the Chronicorp’s CTO of particle research,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:17.280 --> 00:01:22.640
Regina Jackson, summons them to her office.&nbsp;
There, she introduces herself to the two,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:22.640 --> 00:01:26.720
and tells them that humanity is going to die&nbsp;
in a few years if the conditions do not change.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:27.360 --> 00:01:31.680
She then reveals that Ethan is the only one&nbsp;
who can help everyone and save humanity.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:36.160
Ethan is confused and doesn’t believe her.&nbsp;
But Regina insists he visit their lab.
&nbsp;

00:01:36.960 --> 00:01:42.240
The lab has huge machinery. The lab doctor named&nbsp;
Billy Mitchell introduces himself to Ethan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:46.960
and looks at Ethan’s wrist device for a second.&nbsp;
They then explain to him that Ethan’s father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:46.960 --> 00:01:50.320
Dr Richard Whyte, started&nbsp;
this project twenty years ago.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:50.320 --> 00:01:54.240
The machine that stands in front of them&nbsp;
is a time machine called the Chronicle.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:54.240 --> 00:01:58.160
In the first-ever experiment done with the&nbsp;
machine, they had to send radio waves into it&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:01:58.160 --> 00:02:04.960
to check what was on the other side. They found&nbsp;
out through it that 407 years later, in 2474,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:04.960 --> 00:02:09.360
the earth would have enough vegetation to maintain&nbsp;
enough oxygen in the air and sustain human life.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:09.920 --> 00:02:13.920
The people come to believe that if humanity&nbsp;
still exists several hundred years later,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:13.920 --> 00:02:17.840
it is likely that they have found solutions&nbsp;
to all the problems plaguing their reality. 
&nbsp;

00:02:18.640 --> 00:02:24.560
However, a strange activity baffled the scientists&nbsp;
there. The waves they sent had come back reformed.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:29.040
When they decoded it, they found out that someone&nbsp;
from the future had sent them the message saying,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:29.040 --> 00:02:32.160
“Send Ethan Whyte”. 
So now, Regina and the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:32.160 --> 00:02:36.000
whole team want to send Ethan into the&nbsp;
future for him to bring back the cure. 
&nbsp;

00:02:36.000 --> 00:02:40.720
Ethan is beyond surprised. He doesn’t believe&nbsp;
them and thinks that Regina is just bluffing.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:40.720 --> 00:02:45.840
Moreover, he doesn’t want to leave his sick wife&nbsp;
and go into the future. So, he declines to help.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:46.480 --> 00:02:52.080
Later Ethan and Jude are at a diner, where they&nbsp;
buy crisp oxygen. Jude tries to persuade Ethan to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:52.080 --> 00:02:57.280
go through with the plan and help save humanity.&nbsp;
However, Ethan laughs at him, saying that he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:57.280 --> 00:03:01.920
doesn’t want to be like his father. Ethan hates&nbsp;
his father for never being there for him. 
&nbsp;

00:03:01.920 --> 00:03:06.240
20 years ago, his father left home and went&nbsp;
missing, while his mother was killed when he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:06.240 --> 00:03:10.720
was a kid. Since then, he has been brought&nbsp;
up by Jude, a man whom Ethan regards as his&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:10.720 --> 00:03:14.960
older brother as well as a best friend.
He blames him for leaving his mother to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:19.680
complete the project, and doesn’t want to follow&nbsp;
in his path and leave his sick wife. However, Jude&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:19.680 --> 00:03:25.120
manages to persuade him, saying that the only way&nbsp;
he can save his wife is by finding a cure. Ethan&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:25.120 --> 00:03:30.080
reminisces of his eighth birthday when his father&nbsp;
has bought him a strange box as a gift. As he puts&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:30.080 --> 00:03:35.760
his hands inside the box, a device latches onto&nbsp;
his wrist, making him bleed. Richard had placed a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:35.760 --> 00:03:41.680
permanent hand device on his son. It has been many&nbsp;
years but Ethan doesn’t know its use yet. Later at&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:41.680 --> 00:03:46.160
home, Ethan tells Xanthe everything that happened&nbsp;
during the day, and she too insists him to go. 
&nbsp;

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:51.760
The following morning, Ethan scribes, “I will&nbsp;
find my way back to you” on a metal flower,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:51.760 --> 00:03:56.400
and leaves it beside Xanthe. He then goes to&nbsp;
Regina’s office again and tells her that if he&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:56.400 --> 00:04:01.840
can find only one cure, they will have to give it&nbsp;
first to Xanthe. Regina accepts, and takes him to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:01.840 --> 00:04:06.560
the lab again. Dr Mitchell shows him the suit that&nbsp;
he has to wear before getting into the machine.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:07.120 --> 00:04:11.280
As they begin to explain the mission to him,&nbsp;
Ethan realizes that they do not have a plan.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:11.920 --> 00:04:15.280
They have no clue what he will see,&nbsp;
or who he will meet at the other end.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:15.840 --> 00:04:20.720
However, after they put him in the suit, they&nbsp;
give him an AI device called the Archie. Archie&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:20.720 --> 00:04:26.560
will show the lab Ethan's vitals at all times.&nbsp;
It will also help to navigate his location. Then,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:26.560 --> 00:04:32.400
they finally throw him into the machine. Inside,&nbsp;
Ethan moves at high speed through time. He falls&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:32.400 --> 00:04:37.440
from the sky and lands in an unknown jungle. 
The friction from the air causes his suit to catch&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:37.440 --> 00:04:43.520
fire, so he quickly gets out of it. Then, he looks&nbsp;
around, and is astounded by the beauty of nature.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:43.520 --> 00:04:48.320
He finds that the world has completely changed.&nbsp;
The trees and the natural oxygen are back.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:48.880 --> 00:04:53.920
He walks in the direction Archie directs him, and&nbsp;
sees a bunker door of some sort. But what catches&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:53.920 --> 00:04:59.200
his eyes is a skeleton that lies right in front&nbsp;
of the door. Its skull has a bullet hole in it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:04:59.200 --> 00:05:04.480
Furthermore, he looks at the name tag on it and&nbsp;
is horrified to see his own name. The skeleton is&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:04.480 --> 00:05:10.160
Ethan’s. Ethan also finds the skeleton’s Archie,&nbsp;
and plays the last recording on it. He hears a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:10.160 --> 00:05:15.920
man say that this is the only way, and shoots&nbsp;
Ethan. Just then, the device’s power goes off.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:15.920 --> 00:05:21.120
He is horrified, believing that this is the fate&nbsp;
that awaits him. Then, he notices the skeleton’s&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:26.480
wrist device. It is identical to Ethan’s, except&nbsp;
the light glows green in the skeleton’s device,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:26.480 --> 00:05:30.640
but Ethan’s has been red his whole life. 
That night, he lights a fire and eats wild&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:30.640 --> 00:05:35.360
berries. It turns out that the berries&nbsp;
were poisonous. Ethan vomits and starts to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:40.640
go unconscious. Ethan wakes up after a while,&nbsp;
and is surprised to see Jude in front of him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:40.640 --> 00:05:45.040
As it turns out, the lab saw Ethan’s vitals&nbsp;
dropping and assumed he was having a reaction&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:49.680
to poison. So, they quickly sent Jude to&nbsp;
the future, with the cure to save him. 
&nbsp;

00:05:50.480 --> 00:05:54.160
Sometime later, Ethan and Jude find&nbsp;
that his skeleton remains there,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:54.160 --> 00:05:58.240
which means his fate hasn’t changed. They&nbsp;
then use Archie to find another door.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:05:58.800 --> 00:06:04.640
Some device scans Ethan’s eye and grants them&nbsp;
access. When they go in, a monitor welcomes him.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:10.080
It asks him for a DNA sample. When he accepts&nbsp;
it, his wrist device begins to work, making&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:10.080 --> 00:06:15.760
him bleed. After the blood test, it goes green.&nbsp;
The lights to the room turn on and they realize&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:15.760 --> 00:06:21.200
that they are in Chronicorp’s lab, 407 years&nbsp;
later. The time machine is in front of them too.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:21.760 --> 00:06:26.320
Jude gets excited because now they have the means&nbsp;
to go back to the past, but Ethan doesn't think&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:26.320 --> 00:06:30.640
so, saying they haven’t changed anything, and he&nbsp;
will end up dead; just like the dead Ethan.
&nbsp;

00:06:31.360 --> 00:06:35.440
Ethan checks the system log and finds a&nbsp;
holographic recording made by his father,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:35.440 --> 00:06:39.120
who explains that the time machine was&nbsp;
originally designed to collect the oxygen&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:39.120 --> 00:06:43.920
data in the future planet, and then transmit&nbsp;
it back to the past. However, when his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:43.920 --> 00:06:48.720
first started the time machine, he received a&nbsp;
message asking him to send his son to the future.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:53.520
Despite his misgivings, he chose to do so and&nbsp;
made a DNA verification here for Ethan. 
&nbsp;

00:06:54.400 --> 00:06:58.320
Soon, Ethan and Jude realize that the time&nbsp;
machine won't be able to take them back&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:03.520
because its battery has almost depleted after&nbsp;
407 years. What's worse is that the activation&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:03.520 --> 00:07:08.080
of the lab triggers a malfunction in its nuclear&nbsp;
power core, threatening to unleash a nuclear&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:08.080 --> 00:07:12.880
explosion in just four hours. This means they&nbsp;
have to find a way to fix the time machine and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:12.880 --> 00:07:18.480
travel back before the explosion. Running out&nbsp;
of time, they have to act quickly. Outside,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:23.280
they are surprised to find a ruined city covered&nbsp;
with green plants ,but inhabited with no humans,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:28.480
showing that earth starts to recover itself after&nbsp;
human extinction. Human skeletons are scattered&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:28.480 --> 00:07:33.760
everywhere. Ethan gets to his wife's house, only&nbsp;
to find her bones, making him fall into despair.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:38.320
Jude tries to persuade him to go back to&nbsp;
the past, as the cure against the sickness&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:38.320 --> 00:07:44.320
doesn't seem to exist even in the future world.&nbsp;
However, Jude’s words make Ethan suspicious.
&nbsp;

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:48.880
He then turns on the rusty Archie to play the&nbsp;
recording once again, from which he recognizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:48.880 --> 00:07:54.240
Jude's voice and it seems Jude is exactly the&nbsp;
one who shot him. Jude raises his gun at Ethan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:54.240 --> 00:07:59.200
strongly denying that he would shoot ethan. Ethan&nbsp;
finally decides to complete the mission first,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:07:59.200 --> 00:08:03.600
so with joint efforts, they manage to repair&nbsp;
the power core and then return to the lab.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:03.600 --> 00:08:07.520
Now the chronicle system works and they should&nbsp;
be able to return to the past; they just need&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:07.520 --> 00:08:12.800
to wait 37 minutes till portal launch. Once&nbsp;
the countdown reaches zero, the portal will&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:12.800 --> 00:08:19.280
tether to 2067 for approximately 30 seconds.
However, Ethan still finds his body remains behind&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:19.280 --> 00:08:23.440
a door at the same location, which implies that&nbsp;
they haven't made any changes to the future.
&nbsp;

00:08:24.160 --> 00:08:28.560
In order to figure out the truth, Ethan pulls out&nbsp;
the battery of his current Archie and puts it onto&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:28.560 --> 00:08:34.000
the rusty one. In that way, he gets access to&nbsp;
another video, in which Ethan is assured that&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:34.000 --> 00:08:38.960
his future self will be killed by Jude. Jude then&nbsp;
confesses that there is no hope of changing the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:38.960 --> 00:08:44.240
future and he is trying to protect Ethan. Finding&nbsp;
it hard to believe, Ethan locks his brother up in&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:49.440
a room, then plays back his father's holographic&nbsp;
log from the day he died. He soon discovers a&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:49.440 --> 00:08:54.720
conversation between the Chronicorp’s CTO,&nbsp;
Regina Jackson, and his father. It's shown&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:54.720 --> 00:08:59.360
that Ethan's father wanted to use the time&nbsp;
machine to save all mankind by finding the cure,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:08:59.360 --> 00:09:04.000
but the CTO only intended to use the machine to&nbsp;
flee from the dying time with some chosen few.
&nbsp;

00:09:04.720 --> 00:09:08.480
However, whichever plan they choose,&nbsp;
someone must travel into the future and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:08.480 --> 00:09:11.920
turn on the time machine; to safely&nbsp;
send living matter through time,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:11.920 --> 00:09:17.920
it requires an operational link from both sides
In order to stop the CTO with her plan, his father&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:17.920 --> 00:09:23.200
locks the time machine and sets Ethan's DNA as&nbsp;
the verification key. In anger at what Ethan's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:23.200 --> 00:09:28.400
father just did, the CTO killed him immediately.&nbsp;
She then orders Jude to kill Ethan’s mother and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:28.400 --> 00:09:32.800
be a guardian to him, so one day they can use&nbsp;
Ethan’s wristband to get access to the future. 
&nbsp;

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:37.200
Ethan is beyond surprised. The&nbsp;
man he thought of as his brother,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:41.920
turned out to be the one who killed his mother&nbsp;
and is about to kill him too. He also realizes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:41.920 --> 00:09:45.600
that he has misunderstood his father, who&nbsp;
didn't deliberately abandon the family. 
&nbsp;

00:09:46.320 --> 00:09:49.360
Knowing that Regina wants to bring&nbsp;
a chosen few into the future,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:49.360 --> 00:09:54.400
Ethan tries to shut the time machine down, but&nbsp;
Jude rushes to stop Ethan and reveals that he's&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:54.400 --> 00:09:59.280
tasked here by the CTO to ensure that Ethan&nbsp;
is sent in time to repair the power failure.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:09:59.280 --> 00:10:02.400
Once Ethan activates the time&nbsp;
machine, he should kill Ethan.
&nbsp;

00:10:03.120 --> 00:10:06.880
However, Jude has formed close emotional&nbsp;
relations with Ethan over the years.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:07.520 --> 00:10:12.320
Seeing his brother-like friend in that state&nbsp;
because of him, he is guilt-ridden. So, instead&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:12.320 --> 00:10:17.520
of shooting Ethan, he shoots himself dead. 
In rage and regret, Ethan is determined to&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:21.520
fulfil his father's dying wish, which is to&nbsp;
find the cure and save the dying humans. 
&nbsp;

00:10:22.240 --> 00:10:26.560
He looks into the monitor, and finds the&nbsp;
very first message written by his father.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:26.560 --> 00:10:29.680
He deduces that the message “Send&nbsp;
Ethan Whyte” was sent by himself.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:30.320 --> 00:10:35.280
Hence, he codes in the message again and sends it&nbsp;
into the past, along with many other things.
&nbsp;

00:10:35.280 --> 00:10:40.240
Meanwhile, in the laboratory of the year&nbsp;
2067, the CTO with a group of privileged&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:40.240 --> 00:10:43.600
chosen people are waiting anxiously for&nbsp;
the time machine to be activated. 
 
&nbsp;

00:10:44.320 --> 00:10:49.600
To their shock, however, the time machine sends&nbsp;
back hundreds of extinct plants along with a copy&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:49.600 --> 00:10:54.800
of the recorded murder of Ethan's father. Soon&nbsp;
after, the time machine is destroyed by Ethan,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:10:54.800 --> 00:11:00.160
resulting in the collapse of the CTO's plan. In&nbsp;
the end, the CTO is arrested due to the murder.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:00.720 --> 00:11:06.560
The plants sent back to 2067 are cultivated to&nbsp;
revitalize the planet. Ethan's wife also receives&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:06.560 --> 00:11:11.760
a flower sent from him and understands his choice.&nbsp;
While Ethan has to stay in the future world alone,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:11.760 --> 00:11:16.800
he buries Jude and forgives him. A butterfly&nbsp;
catches his attention, and leads him again to the&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:22.000
same entrance, where Ethan is happy to notice that&nbsp;
the corpse of his future self has gone. He rushes&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:22.000 --> 00:11:26.720
to take a look at the world outside, and feels&nbsp;
relieved to see a futuristic eco-friendly city,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:11:26.720 --> 00:11:31.760
in contrast to the deserted one from earlier. His&nbsp;
decision had changed the future of mankind. 
&nbsp;

